GAME SCREEN  

TEXT_COLOR 84
TEXT_POS 11 18
   The game screen has six key areas:

TEXT_POS 11 34
1) Money:  The total in your account is
displayed in the top center of the screen,
and will automatically update  as targets
are destroyed.

TEXT_POS 11 83
2) Shield Status:  The status bar for your
regular shields is displayed along the right
side of the screen.  As you take damage,
the meter will decrease.  Your shields will
recharge, as long as you are not firing, in
all difficulty levels, except Elite.




